message: "Si usas esta colección de papers en tu investigación, por favor cítala como se indica abajo."
title: "Awesome Embodied AI & Sim2Real: A Living Evidence Map for ROS 2, VLA, and Sim2Real"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Roncancio"
    given-names: "Henry Antonio"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9954-9813"
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://github.com/roncanciovl/awesome-embodied-ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/roncanciovl/awesome-embodied-ai"
url: "https://github.com/roncanciovl/awesome-embodied-ai"
abstract: >-
  A curated collection of 41 foundational papers on Embodied AI,
  Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models, Sim2Real transfer, and the
  integration of Large Language Models with ROS 2. Includes structured
  metadata (papers.csv), research protocol, and identified research gaps
  across four sublines: multimodal perception, semantic planning,
  edge AI inference, and Sim2Real safety.
keywords:
  - embodied-ai
  - vision-language-action
  - sim2real
  - ros2
  - large-language-models
  - robotics
  - reinforcement-learning
  - edge-ai
